{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13224100","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13224100","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1322410001:1":{"text":"只要聆听到伟大意志的指引，就可以摆脱这污浊绝望的世界……","source_cn":"只要聆听到伟大意志的指引，就可以摆脱这污浊绝望的世界……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35FC1F29BA6871A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322410002:1":{"text":"污浊绝望？可是……你们在雪松镇的时候也都是能够吃饱穿暖的啊？","source_cn":"污浊绝望？可是……你们在雪松镇的时候也都是能够吃饱穿暖的啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9C8E1BF003235EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322410003:1":{"text":"反对的声音，也是污秽……","source_cn":"反对的声音，也是污秽……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A360CBE1A0D56F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322410004:1":{"text":"信仰之外的言辞只会让我心生杂念……口吐浊气……","source_cn":"信仰之外的言辞只会让我心生杂念……口吐浊气……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB97A841D88203A13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322410005:1":{"text":"没用的，满满。只能先这样把他们带回镇子里了。","source_cn":"没用的，满满。只能先这样把他们带回镇子里了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE662A14CAF6FF332","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_